{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわんこ！\n伊藤純奈です(^○^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/01/14/6303336/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握ライブ中、裏で\nポピパッパパーの歌詞を改めて\n見てたんだけど面白いよね(^O^)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/01/14/6303336/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握、全握2日間\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握の洋服撮り忘れちゃったんだけど\n白のふわふわのトップスにデニムの\nスカート履いてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/01/14/6303336/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は久々にツインテール♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな褒めてくれたから\nよかったー( ^ω^ )\nこの日もたくさんの方が並んで\n下さっていて本当に嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握はみなみさんとペア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/01/14/6303336/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段から良く話すから一緒に\nやってて楽しかった･*･:≡(　ε:)\nありがとうございました❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/01/14/6303336/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、伊織の愛情表現が重くて\n会うと必ず抱きついて来て\n少しでも暇になるとべたべたしてきて\n「純奈だいすき〜〜」って髪の毛が\nぐちゃぐちゃになるまで撫で回されて\n純が怒るって一連の流れがあるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/01/14/6303336/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際伊織のテンションが低い時は\nちょっと寂しいから構ってね♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってこのブログみて伊織が\nわざと冷たくしてくるところ\nまで想像つく（＾∇＾）笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/01/14/6303336/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14枚目シングルの個別握手会の\n応募が始まったのでみなさん\n遊びに来てね〜〜♡部数が増えて\n嬉しいのでこれからもがんばる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/01/14/6303336/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\nおやすみなさい〜"}],"source":"archive"}